e bounty, I am interested in making this work. Its an interesting experience for me tackling such a problem. And yes, feedback, I wanna know what the community thinks as I continue so that I can know where I am going wrong in my approach. \r\n\r\nPlus this is an improvement from the last one. In the previous one, it required a C# user to set up the contract in order to use and the API approach was not available so it was very much out of place.  There was completely nothing in the C# that would enable them to use Godot.\r\n\r\nIn this one, I have been trying to work with the official godotsharp API in order to correctly enable a reliable flow and a C# experience that is similar to GodotSharp API experience but using the memory layer.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4405244354/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4419420396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119330#issuecomment-4419420396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119330","id":4419420396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB2sA7A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://